  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook grain blend: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Fill a medium saucepan three-quarters full with water and bring to the boil. Add the grain blend and cook for 20-22 mins until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/262140/photos/large/cook_grain_blend-252d5c534b7c44817d9201a5f137492f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Meanwhile, trim the brussels sprouts and remove any dark outer leaves, then halve lengthwise. Cut the broccoli stem into 1cm chunks, then cut the head into small florets. Cut the onion into thin wedges. Crush 2 garlic cloves. Coarsely chop the peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/262141/photos/large/prep_ingredients-41366f2547baf51083b2f54dbc35847a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast veggies: Put the brussels sprouts, broccoli and onion on the lined tray and drizzle with 1 tbs vegetable oil, season with salt and pepper and turn to coat. Roast, tossing halfway, for 20-22 mins until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/262142/photos/large/roast_veggies-3c7d44ed5fd34b591a83a3d5bf8b1ac5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sauce: Meanwhile, put the garlic, 2 tsp sriracha (see Make it yours), 1 tbs soy sauce, 2 tsp honey and 2 tbs warm water in a large bowl and stir to combine. Add the veggies and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/262143/photos/large/make_sauce-4e07af481b448a10ac0a5ddb53d2c9d9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the grain blend among bowls, top with the bang bang veggies and scatter over the peanuts. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/262144/photos/large/serve_up-51ca6821cc4e10ef405b23ea87cd3d95.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Tailor the spice level to your taste by adding more or less sriracha sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/262145/photos/large/make_it_yours-e81f7ef0f3faf0db6aafae90e43efa39.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
